aintenance-council-urges-rural-health-priorities-kempthorne-to-be-honored-at-dedication&_bhlid=e4b23eb8ef9175fc9dfaf7efe7b7499c37a1f881","author":["[[Abigail Gerstein]]"],"published":"2026-06-24","created":"2026-07-07","description":"For Paula Mason, the new executive director of the Idaho Educational Services for the Deaf and the Blind, deaf education is personal. At 4 years old, Mason’s father sustained a head injury that left him with profound hearing loss. The accident, however, did not stop Mason’s father from hitchhiking from Pennsylvania to Wyoming. Eventually opening […]"},"task_lines":[],"tasks":{},"codeblock_ranges":[]},